# Excluded from Vercel uploads. Git-triggered builds apply this file to BOTH projects
# (backend at the repository root, website with Root Directory "web"), so it must
# never ignore web/: the website build would lose its own sources. The website's few
# megabytes of source in the backend bundle are harmless.
